  <section class="section"><div class="shell dossier-body"><article>
    <h2>Systems are the common thread.</h2>
    <p>Years spent practising industrial automation and instrumentation established a way of thinking: observe the process, understand its state, identify the interfaces, and design for the person who must operate what remains.</p>
    <p>Software is another medium for constructing systems. Linux provides control over the computing environment. The web provides publication and deployment infrastructure. Photography and field observation record the physical world rather than abstracting it away.</p>
    <p>The work crosses disciplines because the systems themselves do.</p>
